From 3be45c3acbd0017dad909c1dd36b5c56cf79325b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (draft)" <assistant@example.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 10:14:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: publish live session baseline humidity as
 sensor.shower_guard_baseline_humidity

Exposes SessionDetector.active_since_humidity (the reference point
max_humidity_delta is measured from) as its own HA entity, alongside
the existing humidity delta sensor. Published on every Decision Engine
evaluation, showing 'unknown' when no session is active.

No new duplicated logic - this is the same baseline the Decision
Engine already computes deltas against (see ADR-0001); the wiring
layer just publishes what session.py already tracks internally,
including its reset on RESUMED for sibling showers.

Bumps version to 1.3.0.
