 custom_components/shower_guard/const.py      | 10 ++-
 custom_components/shower_guard/manifest.json |  2 +-
 tests/test_init.py                           | 64 ++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 96 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

